       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum for ibuprofen.\n\n- **Maximum dose:** The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision. Over-the-counter labeling caps it at 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** Single doses are usually 400\u2013800 mg, so 1,600 mg per dose is also above the usual range.\n- **Risks at this dose:** The risks include GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove them.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the usual maximum)\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg PO every 6 hours**, or another regimen\n- **1600 mg/day total**, for example 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that it's intentional. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it now."
